      "id": "sol.amc-8-1993-p15.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The four numbers sum to \\(4 \\times 85 = 340,\\) so the remaining three sum to \\(340 - 97 = 243.\\)\n\nTheir mean is \\(243 \\div 3 = 81.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is A .",
